{"id":"b5c3d24e03699135","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-prop-closure-ordinal.md","title":"Ordinal Closure under Suprema","display":"prop-closure-ordinal — Ordinal Closure under Suprema","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-prop-closure-ordinal","aliases":["58-prop-closure-ordinal"],"display":"prop-closure-ordinal — Ordinal Closure under Suprema","depends_on":["[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-prop-closure-ordinal"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-prop-closure-ordinal</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-closure-ordinal — Ordinal Closure under Suprema"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"1d8adfba370086ed\" href=\"?note=1d8adfba370086ed\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md\">../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in V\">\\(X\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span>.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>对序数集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup X\\coloneqq\\bigcup X\">\\(\\sup X\\coloneqq\\bigcup X\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}=\\{\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}=\\{\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}closure\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash\nX\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\sup X=\\bigcup X\n\\land\\sup X\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in X\\;(\\alpha\\leq\\sup X)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\n\\bigl((\\forall\\alpha\\in X\\;\\alpha\\leq\\beta)\\to\\sup X\\leq\\beta\\bigr)\n\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}closure\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash\nX\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\sup X=\\bigcup X\n\\land\\sup X\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in X\\;(\\alpha\\leq\\sup X)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\n\\bigl((\\forall\\alpha\\in X\\;\\alpha\\leq\\beta)\\to\\sup X\\leq\\beta\\bigr)\n\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The statement also covers <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X=\\emptyset\">\\(X=\\emptyset\\)</span>, with <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup\\emptyset=0\">\\(\\sup\\emptyset=0\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md","status":"resolved","id":"1d8adfba370086ed","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-ordclass.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"X\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"X","display":false},{"tex":"\\sup X\\coloneqq\\bigcup X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}=\\{\\alpha:\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}closure\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash\nX\\subseteq\\mathrm{Ord}\n\\to\n\\left[\n\\sup X=\\bigcup X\n\\land\\sup X\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\n\\land\\forall\\alpha\\in X\\;(\\alpha\\leq\\sup X)\n\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\n\\bigl((\\forall\\alpha\\in X\\;\\alpha\\leq\\beta)\\to\\sup X\\leq\\beta\\bigr)\n\\right].","display":true},{"tex":"X=\\emptyset","display":false},{"tex":"\\sup\\emptyset=0","display":false}],"bytes":897,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3944","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-prop-closure-ordinal.md|58-prop-closure-ordinal]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["5582a281f15a33c2","1d8adfba370086ed"]}